2,1,,status,Servas,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Takumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We must ensure the plans are actually executable. I am concerned about whether we have the personnel to support these changes without overworking the current crews.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"We can't just listen to who complains the loudest. We need to know where the time is actually being wasted during the journey, not just where it feels crowded.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A charming start. However, I suspect the ""headline totals"" in these plans are mere fantasies if we don't understand the long-term financial commitments we're inheriting.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us remember that the river of time often flows in circles; we must see if we are repeating old mistakes.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with the need for caution. I am interested in the administrative hurdles and the physical realities that often hide beneath the surface of a drawing.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, financial transparency is important, but a balanced ledger means nothing if there is no one available to drive the trains or maintain the tracks.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Exactly. If we just fix the ""loud"" parts, we're wasting money. I want to see the actual data on where the minutes go.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, your passion for the staff is admirable. Yet, I've seen many a ""staffing solution"" become a permanent debt trap. We need to see the actual ledger.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience, my friends. The wisdom of the past is a lantern for our future. I intend to look at what we tried years ago to avoid blind enthusiasm.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we should also consider who holds the power of approval. The most elegant plan can be stalled by a single committee's hesitation.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will focus on the crew establishment and the roster books. We cannot promise improvements that the current workforce cannot physically deliver.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm going for the journey audits and the timed runs. I want the hard numbers on passenger time, not just anecdotes from the board.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees. I prefer to know exactly which pot the money is coming from.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall look into the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme. Let us learn from our ancestors.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells. I want to see the hidden risks.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
